al RAG system for brain MRI analysis — BioMedCLIP + Qdrant retrieval with Gemini-generated, evidence-grounded diagnostic explanations.</p><div class=\"mt-8 aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800\"><div class=\"relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit] bg-slate-800\"><img alt=\"NeuroRAG\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fprojects%2Fsangrahak.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AyushPawshe08/NeuroRAG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 px-5 py-2.5 text-[16px] font-semibold hover:bg-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 transition-colors\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M320 0c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32s14.3 32 32 32l82.7 0L201.4 265.4c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0L448 109.3l0 82.7c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32l0-160c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32L320 0zM80 32C35.8 32 0 67.8 0 112L0 432c0 44.2 35.8 80 80 80l320 0c44.2 0 80-35.8 80-80l0-112c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32s-32 14.3-32 32l0 112c0 8.8-7.2 16-16 16L80 448c-8.8 0-16-7.2-16-16l0-320c0-8.8 7.2-16 16-16l112 0c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32s-14.3-32-32-32L80 32z\"></path></svg>Live Demo</a><a href=\"https://github.com/AyushPawshe08/NeuroRAG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 px-5 py-2.5 text-[16px] font-semibold hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-neutral-900 transition-colors\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M165.9 397.4c0 2-2.3 3.6-5.2 3.6-3.3.3-5.6-1.3-5.6-3.6 0-2 2.3-3.6 5.2-3.6 3-.3 5.6 1.3 5.6 3.6zm-31.1-4.5c-.7 2 1.3 4.3 4.3 4.9 2.6 1 5.6 0 6.2-2s-1.3-4.3-4.3-5.2c-2.6-.7-5.5.3-6.2 2.3zm44.2-1.7c-2.9.7-4.9 2.6-4.6 4.9.3 2 2.9 3.3 5.9 2.6 2.9-.7 4.9-2.6 4.6-4.6-.3-1.9-3-3.2-5.9-2.9zM244.8 8C106.1 8 0 113.3 0 252c0 110.9 69.8 205.8 169.5 239.2 12.8 2.3 17.3-5.6 17.3-12.1 0-6.2-.3-40.4-.3-61.4 0 0-70 15-84.7-29.8 0 0-11.4-29.1-27.8-36.6 0 0-22.9-15.7 1.6-15.4 0 0 24.9 2 38.6 25.8 21.9 38.6 58.6 27.5 72.9 20.9 2.3-16 8.8-27.1 16-33.7-55.9-6.2-112.3-14.3-112.3-110.5 0-27.5 7.6-41.3 23.6-58.9-2.6-6.5-11.1-33.3 2.6-67.9 20.9-6.5 69 27 69 27 20-5.6 41.5-8.5 62.8-8.5s42.8 2.9 62.8 8.5c0 0 48.1-33.6 69-27 13.7 34.7 5.2 61.4 2.6 67.9 16 17.7 25.8 31.5 25.8 58.9 0 96.5-58.9 104.2-114.8 110.5 9.2 7.9 17 22.9 17 46.4 0 33.7-.3 75.4-.3 83.6 0 6.5 4.6 14.4 17.3 12.1C428.2 457.8 496 362.9 496 252 496 113.3 383.5 8 244.8 8zM97.2 352.9c-1.3 1-1 3.3.7 5.2 1.6 1.6 3.9 2.3 5.2 1 1.3-1 1-3.3-.7-5.2-1.6-1.6-3.9-2.3-5.2-1zm-10.8-8.1c-.7 1.3.3 2.9 2.3 3.9 1.6 1 3.6.7 4.3-.7.7-1.3-.3-2.9-2.3-3.9-2-.6-3.6-.3-4.3.7zm32.4 35.6c-1.6 1.3-1 4.3 1.3 6.2 2.3 2.3 5.2 2.6 6.5 1 1.3-1.3.7-4.3-1.3-6.2-2.2-2.3-5.2-2.6-6.5-1zm-11.4-14.7c-1.6 1-1.6 3.6 0 5.9 1.6 2.3 4.3 3.3 5.6 2.3 1.6-1.3 1.6-3.9 0-6.2-1.4-2.3-4-3.3-5.6-2z\"></path></svg>Source Code</a></div><div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\">About</h2><ul class=\"mt-5 list-disc list-inside space-y-3\"><li class=\"text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">NeuroRAG is a multimodal retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform engineered for brain MRI analysis, connecting complex biomedical scans directly with diagnostic context and clinical knowledge.</li><li class=\"text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">The system uses BioMedCLIP to generate joint image-text embeddings from MRI scans, storing and indexing them in a Qdrant vector database for high-accuracy similarity search across confirmed medical cases.</li><li class=\"text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">Retrieved case contexts and patient MRI representations are passed to Google Gemini to formulate structured, evidence-grounded diagnostic explanations, delivered through a Gradio interface containerized with Docker.</li></ul></div><div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Technologies &amp; Tools</h2><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-slate-50 dark:bg-neutral-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800 px-4 py-2 text-[15px] font-medium\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" color=\"#3776AB\" style=\"color:#3776AB\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M14.25.18l.9.2.73.26.59.3.45.32.34.34.25.34.16.33.1.3.04.26.02.2-.01.13V8.5l-.05.63-.13.55-.21.46-.26.38-.3.31-.33.25-.35.19-.35.14-.33.1-.3.07-.26.04-.21.02H8.77l-.69.05-.59.14-.5.22-.41.27